> * Once you enter the room with MEDUSA, do you get any turns
>   or are you instantly stoned (was wearing blessed speed boots,
>   if that matters).
>
Medusa always sits on the down staircase, so if you enter from below you'll 
be stoned instantenously. If you enter the room normally you usually have
one turn (to put the blindfold on). I'm not sure how speed affects this.

The rule is: if you got down to maze levels without killing medusa (trap door,
level teleport...) always blind yourself just before going upstairs.
That's why levels below medusa are mazes - this allows you to know you are
below her and gives you a chance to protect yourself.

